History:
========

1.4.18 - 09 March 2016, Sylvain ALBERT
    - First public release
      . The library is derived from Ludovic Rousseau's CCID library.
      . Remove USB and TwinSerie management.
      . Add network management for SpringCard readers.

1.4.19 - 28 September 2016, Sylvain ALBERT
    - Second public release
      . No read after select fails.
      . Trace the unsupported message command.

1.4.19 - 16 November 2016, Sylvain ALBERT
    - Third public release
      . CmdNetworkGetSlotStatus modified. Change buffer[7] by reader_index.
        buffer[7] should be the slot index but not the case on armbian.

1.4.20 - 14 January 2021, Sylvain ALBERT
    - Fourth public release
      . Commit from Vincent Jardin.
      . Fill IFD_bcdDevice, sIFD_iManufacturer, sIFD_serial_number from reader
        settings.

1.4.21 - 20 June 2022, Sylvain ALBERT
    - Public release
      . Commit from Matthieu Barreteau.
      . Reliable string CCID enumeration at startup.
      . Add basic multislot management for SpringPark.

1.4.22 - 05 March 2025, Sylvain ALBERT
    - Public release
      . Improve basic multislot management for SpringPark.
      . Correct bug connect/disconnect reader.

1.4.23 - 23 September 2025, Sylvain ALBERT
    - Public release
      . Fix issue pthread_cond_wait.
      . Fix issue concurrent access to reader.
